      "case_id": "squad-572883a33acd2414000dfa7b",
      "question": "Where in Central Asia did the Han Chinese move?",
      "source_text_sha256": "55bbfa9052d82fc2074807e0795fc8957a358974ef289c3f0e19e4e8dbb35f85",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "document_sha256": "55bbfa9052d82fc2074807e0795fc8957a358974ef289c3f0e19e4e8dbb35f85",
          "utf8_start": 0,
          "utf8_end": 309,
          "quote": "At the same time the Mongols imported Central Asian Muslims to serve as administrators in China, the Mongols also sent Han Chinese and Khitans from China to serve as administrators over the Muslim population in Bukhara in Central Asia, using foreigners to curtail the power of the local peoples of both lands."
        },
